SUMMARY:[POPL 26] Submission Deadline
DESCRIPTION:Extracted automatically by a small language model\; please cro
 ss-check against the source before relying on it: https://conf.researchr.
 org/track/POPL-2026/POPL-2026-popl-research-papers\n\nPOPL 2026 seeks con
 tributions on all aspects of programming languages and programming system
 s\, both theoretical and practical. Authors must omit their names and ins
 titutions from their paper submissions due to full double-blind reviewing
 . References to authors' own prior work should be in the third person. Th
 e submission site is https://popl26.hotcrp.com. Each paper should have no
  more than 25 pages of text\, excluding bibliography\, using the PACMPL f
 ormat (specifically\, the acmart LaTeX class with acmsmall option). Concu
 rrent paper submissions to other conferences\, workshops\, journals\, or 
 similar forums of publication are not allowed.\n\nSubmit at: https://popl
 26.hotcrp.com\n\nhttps://github.com/JonasAlaif/pl-conferences
END:VEVENT
