SUMMARY:[PLDI 26] Submission Deadline
DESCRIPTION:Extracted automatically by a small language model\; please cro
 ss-check against the source before relying on it: https://pldi26.sigplan.
 org/track/pldi-2026-papers\n\nPACMPL Issue PLDI 2026 seeks contributions 
 on all aspects of programming languages research. The selection of papers
  will be made in two rounds of reviewing with an author response period. 
 Author names and affiliations must be omitted from submissions (double-bl
 ind reviewing). Authors can submit multiple times prior to the deadline\,
  but only the last submission will be reviewed. There is no deadline for 
 submitting abstracts. The submission site is https://pldi2026.hotcrp.com.
 \n\nSubmit at: https://pldi2026.hotcrp.com\n\nhttps://github.com/JonasAla
 if/pl-conferences
