SUMMARY:[LICS 26] Submission Deadline
DESCRIPTION:Extracted automatically by a small language model\; please cro
 ss-check against the source before relying on it: https://lics.siglog.org
 /lics26/cfp.php\n\nPapers must be submitted in the ACM SIGCONF Proceeding
 s 2-column format and may be at most 12 pages\, excluding references. Pap
 ers authored or co-authored by members of the PC are allowed\, with at mo
 st one submission per PC member. Results must be unpublished and not subm
 itted for publication elsewhere. The paper must be in English. LICS 2026 
 will use a lightweight double-blind reviewing process.\n\nSubmit at: http
 s://submissions.floc26.org/lics/\n\nhttps://github.com/JonasAlaif/pl-conf
 erences
END:VEVENT
