DESCRIPTION:Extracted automatically by a small language model\; please cro
 ss-check against the source before relying on it: http://conferences.i-ca
 v.org/2026/cfp/\n\nPapers can include a clearly marked appendix\, however
 \, the reviewers are not obliged to read the contents of these appendices
 . All page limits do not include references and appendices. Papers in all
  four categories must be submitted by January 28\, 2026 AoE\, and should 
 be in LNCS format. Note Springer's guidelines regarding AI Authorship. Si
 multaneous submission to other conferences with proceedings or submission
  of material that has already been published elsewhere is not allowed.\n\
 nSubmit at: https://submissions.floc26.org/cav/\n\nhttps://github.com/Jon
 asAlaif/pl-conferences
