SUMMARY:[ICFP 26] Submission Deadline
DESCRIPTION:Extracted automatically by a small language model\; please cro
 ss-check against the source before relying on it: https://icfp26.sigplan.
 org/track/icfp-2026-icfp-papers\n\nSubmissions must be in PDF format\, pr
 intable in black and white on US Letter sized paper and interpretable by 
 common PDF tools. All submissions must adhere to the "ACM Small" template
 . There is a limit of 25 pages for a full paper or Functional Pearl and 1
 2 pages for an Experience Report\; the bibliography and an optional clear
 ly marked appendix will not be counted against these limits. Submissions 
 that exceed the page limits or do not meet formatting requirements will b
 e desk rejected. The conference uses a full double-blind reviewing proces
 s where author identities are omitted from submissions. Authors may submi
 t improved versions before the deadline. Authors of conditionally accepte
 d papers must provide revised submissions by 3 June 2026 accompanied by a
  cover letter mapping each mandatory revision request to specific parts o
 f the paper.\n\nSubmit at: https://icfp26.hotcrp.com\n\nhttps://github.co
 m/JonasAlaif/pl-conferences
END:VEVENT
