SUMMARY:[SPLASH 26] Volunteer Application Deadline
DESCRIPTION:Extracted automatically by a small language model\; please cro
 ss-check against the source before relying on it: https://2026.splashcon.
 org/track/splash-issta-2026-student-volunteers\n\nThe page states that ev
 eryone is welcome to apply\, with priority given to junior members of the
  community (full- or part-time students of computer science and related f
 ields). Volunteers receive a complimentary conference registration coveri
 ng all open sessions and proceedings\, free lunches/refreshments during b
 reaks\, a volunteer shirt\, and free admission to social events. They are
  responsible for their own travel and accommodation. To apply\, one must 
 send an email to thalakottur.m@northeastern.edu\, robert.zhang@utexas.edu
 \, or hnzhu@ucdavis.edu if they have questions\, though the page also pro
 vides a direct link to apply.\n\nApply at: https://tinyurl.com/splash-iss
 ta-sv26\n\nNote: the page also states "Apply here by July 12".\n\nhttps:/
 /github.com/JonasAlaif/pl-conferences
END:VEVENT
